        <object id="notes" label="&lt;b&gt;Gaps (not drawn):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Networking: no VNet, private endpoint or firewall rule set is stated beyond &amp;#x27;firewall&amp;#x27; on the PostgreSQL server (AD-17 step 2). Which source addresses may reach PostgreSQL, and is everything public-endpoint by design (PaaS only, $10 ceiling)?&lt;br&gt;• ACS Email stores email data in &amp;#x27;Asia Pacific&amp;#x27;, not strictly southeastasia: is that acceptable under P-15 residency (spine Open Questions)?&lt;br&gt;• Is Document Intelligence API 2024-11-30 served in southeastasia (spine Open Questions)?&lt;br&gt;• Terraform state storage (AD-17 step 1) sits in a resource group the spine doesn&amp;#x27;t name; not drawn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each element's source is in grey under its name and in its tooltip.">
          <mxCell style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fillColor=#FAFAFA;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
